  "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd a repository root `.gitattributes` configuration to enforce LF line endings for text files on Windows checkouts. Add explicit binary rules so Git does not change binary fixtures.\n\n## What Changed\n\n- Add `* text=auto eol=lf` to repository root `.gitattributes`.\n- Add explicit `binary` rules for geometry and image fixtures (`*.png`, `*.ico`, `*.woff`, `*.woff2`, `*.step`, `*.stp`, `*.stl`).\n- Update `testdata` rules to `text diff merge eol=lf` so ASCII test models keep LF line endings while retaining text diff and merge behavior.\n\n## Pinning Tests\n\n- `xtask::example_line_endings::all_example_nc_files_keep_lf_with_autocrlf`\n- `xtask::example_line_endings::all_golden_and_fixture_files_have_eol_lf`\n- `xtask::example_line_endings::golden_and_fixture_files_keep_lf_with_autocrlf`\n\n## Not Exercised\n\n- Automatic renormalization of pre-existing files on `main` (kept untouched per issue instructions).\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #3795\n",
